Z||000041||Urchin||09-30-2001||12:58 PM||||I noticed a couple of people mentioned discarding the signatures all together, or a thumnail.  Personally, I think that would be a shame.  Signatures are great for a number of reasons.  1. your personal i.d., 2. show off your car/see others cars conveniently 3. often I will use my signature in lengthy threads so I can easily make my way to those posts I havent read yet. 4.  looks cool  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.  <BR>I don't know a lot about computers, but for those having problems...  would it be possible to have it as an option?  "show signatures" with a box to check off when you log on.  Just a thought.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/final.jpg"> <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
