Z||000049||Alex4mula||10-02-2001||02:58 PM||||Either in a PC or a Web TV I found big flashy signatures annoying. Specially when they are repeated many times too. Go to a Vette Forum and see how bad it can get. Also those long list of mods/cars are in the same category to me. Something like this (extremme case but seen it):<P>Carl V. *****Authorized Zaino Distributor*****<BR>Huntingdon Valley, PA.<BR>2002 Z06 Electron Blue/Mod Red<BR>**FOR SALE** 2000 Magnetic Red Convertible **FOR SALE**  <A HREF="http://www.hcvind.com" TARGET=_blank>www.hcvind.com</A> <BR>E-Mail: carl@hcvind.com<P>98 C5<BR>Borla XR1 Exhaust<BR>B&B headers: <BR>Donaldson Intake <BR>Ripper <BR>Low Temp Thermo <BR>Spiro Pro Wires <BR>Lowering Kit <P>80 Black C-3 L-82 102K<BR>87 GN 42K few mods<BR>86 GN 63K few mods<BR>86 GN 90K many mods<BR>89 GTA 5.7L 36K<BR>00 Grand Am GT 5.5K<BR>All Black!!!!!<BR>Few other minor toys<P>Who cares how many cars/mods you have above 2. I can have a very long one if I just include the mods to the rear of only one of my cars. Keep it short keep it simple. Put the words only on the info asked. Just my opinion.||||reg||1
