Z||000059||Cliff Pennock||10-03-2001||08:05 PM||||JFHC! Don't turn this into a "why does mine have to go while others can stay?".<P>I ask a simple question if people would please size their signatures down, and to use a signature for what it's meant. I <B>am</B> trying to leave this up to people's good judgement. I don't like large signatures and I don't like banner type sigs. Ask yourself what it is that you are trying to achieve with your signature. If you are trying to show off your ride, fine, that's great - that's what the signatures are there for. If your signature is purely for directing people to your site, then <B>please</B> use a text link! But whatever you do, try to make your sig as small as possible. I'm asking this because I get a lot of complaints about people's signatures. Some threads load extremey slow because of them. And remember there are a lot of people using 56K modems.<BR>||||reg||1
